    "name": "Mark43 Partnerships Associated Records Vehicles API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Mark43's Partnerships (External) API lets approved law-enforcement technology partners integrate with a Mark43 agency's cloud RMS and CAD: create and read reports, persons, evidence and chain-of-custody, attachments, CAD events, warrants, tasks, users, and E911 data. REST over HTTPS with JSON payloads and HTTP Basic authentication using secure API tokens.",
